              "type": "string",
              "value": "=AI triage verdict from the Module 2 workflow (chain per indicator, model {{ $env.MODEL_WEAK }}).\n\nIndicator verdicts:\n{{ $('Assemble verdicts').first().json.indicatorVerdicts.map(v => '- ' + v.indicator_type + ' ' + (v.indicator || 'n/a') + ': ' + v.verdict + ' (' + String(v.evidence || '') + ')').join('\\n') }}\n\nSummary:\n{{ $json.output.summary }}\n\nSuggested close state: {{ $json.output.suggested_close_state }}\n\nRecommended actions:\n{{ $json.output.recommended_actions }}\n\nThe same verdict with the indicator table is appended to the case description."
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "description",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Webhook').first().json.body.object.description || '' }}\n\n---\n\n## AI triage verdict\n\n### Indicator verdicts\n\n| Type | Indicator | Verdict | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|---|\n{{ $('Assemble verdicts').first().json.indicatorVerdicts.map(v => '| ' + v.indicator_type + ' | `' + (v.indicator || 'n/a') + '` | **' + v.verdict + '** | ' + String(v.evidence || '').replace(/\\|/g, '/') + ' |').join('\\n') }}\n\n### Summary\n\n{{ $json.output.summary }}\n\n### Suggested close state\n\n{{ $json.output.suggested_close_state }}\n\n### Recommended actions\n\n{{ $json.output.recommended_actions }}\n\nWritten by the Module 2 workflow (chain per indicator, model {{ $env.MODEL_WEAK }})."
            }
